.DS_Store
*.pyc
*.egg-info
*.swp
tags
node_modules
__pycache__

# WhatsApp linked-device session (creds.json etc). Belongs only in the real
# site's private/files dir (santu_smart_connect), written there by
# smart_connect_bridge.py -- but a wrong cwd/env during manual testing has
# produced a stray copy nested inside this app's own source tree before
# (2026-08-16), which is both junk and a way to leak session keys into git.
# This blocks that class of mistake from ever being committed.
santu_hardware/whatsapp_bridge/site1.local/
santu_hardware/whatsapp_bridge/*/private/
santu_hardware/tests/tmp_*
# Test run output: regenerated on every run, and the rows carry the shop's own
# customer names and phone numbers. Keep them on disk, out of the repo.
santu_hardware/tests/reports/

# Regenerated byte-for-byte differently on every OCR test run (the PDF
# carries a timestamp), so it showed up as a change after each run.
santu_hardware/tests/fixtures/ocr_bill.pdf
